      "content": "\r\n  float3 vRefl = texCUBE(reflMap, IN.Tex0.xyz).xyz * IN.Color.xyz + IN.Color1.xyz;\r\n  float4 vBase = tex2D(baseMap, IN.Tex1.xy);\r\n  float4 vColor;\r\n  vColor.xyz = HDREncodeAmb(vRefl.xyz + vBase.xyz - 0.5);\r\n  vColor.a = vBase.a * IN.Color.a;\r\n\r\n  OUT.Color = vColor;"
    }
